    "$type": "dimension",
    "$description": "ONE scale. The export shipped this same ladder nine times over -- gap, px, py, mx, my, space-x, space-y, width, height: 289 tokens carrying 36 distinct values. Which property consumes a length is a utility concern, not a token one. Steps are Tailwind names, with `.5` written `-5` so the name survives a dot-delimited token path.",
